# The build context of scripts/deploy/Dockerfile, the repository root: the
# manifests, Cargo.lock, crates/, docs/guide/ (the guide the binaries embed),
# ui/ without its installed packages or build, and the three scripts the image
# runs. Everything else stays out.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!docs/guide/
!ui/
!scripts/deploy/entrypoint.sh
!scripts/deploy/clone.sh
!scripts/deploy/health.sh

# Out again, at the top and at any depth inside what came back.
target
target.noindex
.git
node_modules
**/target
**/target.noindex
**/.git
**/node_modules
ui/dist
ui/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
